  "body": "Nothing to do, everything to love, with views to Rangitoto, only steps to the beach and a true north aspect capturing all-day sun.\r\n\r\nThis isn't just a home, this is a lifestyle, with the summer breeze, clean architectural lines and low-maintenance appeal. This remarkable modern foothold in a blue-chip setting offers an incredible opportunity to secure a newly renovated home in one of Auckland's most sought-after bayside locations.\r\n\r\nYou'll appreciate thoughtful design, effortless old-money luxury and a strong sense of proportion, with clean lines, natural light and high-specification finishes throughout. Every detail has been considered, from the designer kitchen and brand-new bathrooms to heated floors, double glazing, a heat pump, new flooring, and a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite. Three generous bedrooms are privately positioned on the ground level, while upstairs, light-filled open-plan living is oriented to capture the natural light and postcard views.\r\n\r\nSummer walks, welcomed home by softly lit pathways, landscaped gardens and a park-like setting. A covered double carport provides secure off-street parking, with ample space for a boat, while Patterson Reserve is just a short stroll away for our furry friends.\r\n\r\nLocated on the Mission Bay fringe, just a three-minute (approx.) drive to Mission Bay Beach, with Orakei Basin, Eastridge Shopping Centre, cafes, restaurants and waterfront boardwalks all within easy reach. \r\n\r\nZoned for Orakei School, Selwyn College, and Baradene College, this is bayside living with everything you need, without compromise.",
